1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,720
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 5=

5
00:00:42,399 --> 00:00:43,200
You made these?

6
00:00:45,119 --> 00:00:46,280
Fen went back to her hometown today,

7
00:00:47,119 --> 00:00:48,039
so I threw something together.

8
00:00:48,679 --> 00:00:49,799
I hope you like it.

9
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:58,000
I didn't know you could cook.

10
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,000
Try it.

11
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:09,959
It's delicious.

12
00:01:12,959 --> 00:01:14,159
When I was in Africa,

13
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:15,959
I had to cook for myself.

14
00:01:16,799 --> 00:01:17,959
That's when I learned how to cook.

15
00:01:20,319 --> 00:01:20,959
Then,

16
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:23,840
I'll do the dishes.

17
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,079
No need.

18
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:26,159
Just leave them.

19
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,920
You cook, I clean.

20
00:01:28,159 --> 00:01:28,799
That's fair.

21
00:01:37,159 --> 00:01:37,480
Here.

22
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:38,640
Have some meat.

23
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:53,840
I made you a fruit bowl.

24
00:01:54,159 --> 00:01:55,000
It's got all kinds of fruit,

25
00:01:55,239 --> 00:01:55,840
but no mango.

26
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,120
You can eat it without worry.

27
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,280
Thanks.

28
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:03,040
How do you know I don't eat mango?

29
00:02:04,599 --> 00:02:05,159
Bao'er told me.

30
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:19,199
Is it good?

31
00:02:20,759 --> 00:02:21,240
Very good.

32
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:31,719
Mr. Xie,

33
00:02:34,639 --> 00:02:35,280
this is...

34
00:02:36,159 --> 00:02:36,639
for you.

35
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,479
Thanks for taking such good care of me.

36
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:52,400
And for the rose garden from Bao'er.

37
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,080
I...

38
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:54,960
I'm glad you like it.

39
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,240
It's a perfect fit.

40
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:14,759
I asked Bao'er.

41
00:03:16,039 --> 00:03:16,960
(Bao'er?)

42
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:18,560
(She wouldn't care about my size.)

43
00:03:24,759 --> 00:03:25,400
It fits perfectly.

44
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,879
I'm glad you like it.

45
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:31,080
I'd better go.

46
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:42,879
I had a great time today.

47
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:54,520
I... I'd better go.

48
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,120
I'm meeting Bao'er.

49
00:04:16,340 --> 00:04:20,000
♪The party's alive, the crowd glows♪

50
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:24,279
See?

51
00:04:24,519 --> 00:04:26,600
I told you this nail salon was good.

52
00:04:27,079 --> 00:04:27,560
Looks great.

53
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:34,399
Hello?

54
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:35,720
Mrs. Wen.

55
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,040
Hua,

56
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:40,439
your brother and Sirong's
engagement party...

57
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:41,839
You must come.

58
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:44,800
You two grew up together.

59
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,759
Even if he's marrying someone else,

60
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,920
I still hope you'll be there.

61
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,480
I know

62
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,040
Zheng let you down.

63
00:05:01,279 --> 00:05:02,079
Okay, Mrs. Wen.

64
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,360
I'll be there on time.

65
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,600
Good.

66
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:08,279
Wait,

67
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:09,319
you're really going

68
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:11,000
to Gu Zheng and Li Sirong's
engagement party?

69
00:05:11,959 --> 00:05:13,800
Mrs. Wen treats me best
in the Gu family.

70
00:05:14,279 --> 00:05:15,079
She asked me herself.

71
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:16,720
I couldn't say no.

72
00:05:18,519 --> 00:05:20,639
Li Sirong must've put her up to it.

73
00:05:20,839 --> 00:05:22,079
She wants you there,

74
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:25,120
so she can humiliate you.

75
00:05:26,519 --> 00:05:26,879
How about this?

76
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:28,800
Take my dad with you.

77
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,040
He'll back you up.

78
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:31,279
No one would dare mess with you.

79
00:05:31,399 --> 00:05:31,920
No.

80
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:33,519
Why not?

81
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,759
You're married.

82
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:36,279
You have every right to bring him.

83
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:39,000
We're keeping our marriage secret.

84
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,079
We had an agreement.

85
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:41,879
Unless I have no choice,

86
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:44,199
I don't want to go public.

87
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:45,279
You're not

88
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,240
still hung up on Gu Zheng, are you?

89
00:05:47,399 --> 00:05:48,279
Don't be silly.

90
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,199
Get me a dress.

91
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,519
Bust, 88 cm,

92
00:05:57,759 --> 00:05:58,439
waist, 60 cm,

93
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,240
hips, 90 cm. Have it custom-made.

94
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:01,600
Zhouhan,

95
00:06:02,079 --> 00:06:02,920
impressive!

96
00:06:03,879 --> 00:06:05,759
You know her measurements by heart.

97
00:06:06,519 --> 00:06:07,959
How well do you know your wife?

98
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:09,399
I'm her husband.

99
00:06:10,199 --> 00:06:10,879
Of course I know.

100
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:31,760
♪You say you don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

101
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:35,160
♪You're just fine on your own♪

102
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:38,320
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

103
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:41,320
♪And the pain you face at night♪

104
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:45,000
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

105
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:48,200
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

106
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:51,280
♪Some love needs no promises♪

107
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:54,640
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

108
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:57,320
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

109
00:06:57,320 --> 00:07:00,640
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

110
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:03,480
♪I'm right behind you♪

111
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:07,040
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

112
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:09,680
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

113
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:13,640
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

114
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:19,960
♪I'm right behind you♪

115
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,760
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

116
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,600
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

117
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:26,160
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

118
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:27,600
♪I'm right behind you♪

119
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:29,960
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

120
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:31,720
♪I won't claim you♪

121
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,400
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

122
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:36,040
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

123
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:39,400
♪Waiting for you♪
